Package: readboj
Title: Auditable Access to Bank of Japan Statistics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Chartwell",
    family = "Macro",
    email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
  )
Description: Provides auditable access to official Bank of Japan statistics.
    Retrieves observations through the Time-Series Data Search API, discovers
    and reads selected official bulk files, and accesses dated Tankan
    comprehensive-data release assets. Preserves source identity, raw-response
    hashes, bilingual metadata, and bounded cache snapshots for reproducible
    offline workflows. Includes published Outlook Report forecast tables,
    validated numeric history for local reads, atomic incremental source
    updates, and calendar-aware release maintenance.
